 "text": "Tristan is the romantic hero of the Arthurian tale. He served as a spy for King Mark, the husband of his lover Iseult. Some texts say that Mark had Tristan killed to win that honor. In another account the knight Tristan frees a king with the help of Arthur. Through all the endings the tale is one of a love that cannot be. Tristan and Iseult stand among the great lovers of romance.",
